OL,3,GNEWSACordon as armed police respond to
OL,4,Aknife reports
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major road in Nottingham is closed
OL,7,Fwhile police "engage with a man" inside
OL,8,Fa house.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Police said officers
OL,11,Fwere at an address on Ilkeston Road
OL,12,Fafter receiving reports a man "was in
OL,13,Fpossession of a knife" at about 10:55
OL,14,FBST on Friday.
OL,16,FA police cordon has been put in place
OL,17,Fnear the junction with Balfour Road,
OL,18,Fwith traffic being diverted on to
OL,19,Fneighbouring routes.
OL,21,FThe force is advising members of the
OL,22,Fpublic to "avoid the immediate area".
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
